# Workspace Root Variable
RULE: Set UNIFIED_TRADING_WORKSPACE_ROOT in shell profile. All workspace scripts reference this variable.
WHY: Allows sharing workspace configs without hardcoding paths; works across different developer machines.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/workspace-root-variable.md
DO: Add to ~/.zshrc once; use ${UNIFIED_TRADING_WORKSPACE_ROOT} in scripts
NEVER: Hardcode absolute paths in workspace scripts; commit workspace-specific paths to git
